\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .  O, that I had a thousand voices, 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj A mouth to speak with thousand tongues!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That while my heart in Him rejoices,
\par Would I proclaim in grateful song
\par To all, wherever I might be,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj What things the Lord hath done for me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Dear Father, endless praise I render
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj for soul and body strangely joined.
\par I praise thee Guardian kind and tender,
\par for all the noble joys I find.
\par So richly giv'n on every side
\par and freely for my use supplied.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  What equal praises can I offer
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 dear Jesus, for Thy mercy shown?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj What pains, dear Saviour, didst thou suffer
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  and thus for all my sins along?
\par  Thy death alone my soul could free
\par  from satan, to be blest by Thee!
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj 4. Let all my praise, up to Thee reaching,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj  be Thine, too, spirit of all grace.
\par  Whose Holy pow'r and faithful teaching
\par  gives me among Thy saints a place. 
\par  What e'er of good in me may shine
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  comes only from Thy light divine.
\par  
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj 5.   Accept, O Lord, I now implore Thee,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  the meager praise I give below
\par  in heav'n I better will adore Thee
\par  When I, an angel's strength I know.
\par  There would I join their sacred praise 
\par  and heav'nly hallelujahs raise.
\par \pard 
\par \cf1\f1 
\par \ul\b\f2 
\par }

